	SAY NAME1 "Potion"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Potions are typically found in ceramic, crystal, glass, or metal flasks or vials. Flasks or other containers generally contain enough fluid to provide one person with one complete dose to achieve the effects of the potion.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1"


	SAY NAME2 "Potion of Strength"
	SAY DESC "This potion increases the strength of the user. When it is consumed, the individual gains great strength and bonuses to hit and damage while using any hand-held or thrown weapon. The effect will last the full duration, which is 3 hours, or until dispelled.

STATISTICS:

Strength: 18
Duration: 3 hours

Weight: 1" 





